url: "https://github.com/IamRamgarhia/OpenAdKit-Open-Source-AI-Marketing-Tool"
abstract: >
  OpenAdKit is a browser-only, MIT-licensed AI marketing and advertising platform
  that replaces a stack of $49–$499/month SaaS marketing tools (Jasper, AdCreative,
  Anyword, Pencil, Copy.ai, Marpipe) with a single open-source app. Users bring
  their own AI provider key — free tier (Groq, Cerebras, Gemini, OpenRouter) or
  paid (Claude, OpenAI, Mistral, DeepSeek, Together AI) — and get 18 ad generators
  across Google, Meta, TikTok, YouTube, LinkedIn and X, plus 11 optimization tools
  (CTR optimizer, Quality Score improver, budget waste analyzer, ad fatigue
  detector, and more), competitor research, brand intelligence, content calendars,
  step-by-step launch guides for non-technical users, a provider comparison that
  reports each AI's free-tier limits and measured cost, and a folder-portable data
  layer. No backend, no telemetry, and no account is required.
